A Higher Kind is an umbrella term for the beings first born from the primordial singularity at the start of time. Higher Kinds formed before the [[Geography/index|Astra]] was stable enough to form local [[Phenomena/Weave|Weaves]], so they're tied directly to the underlying [[Phenomena/Aetheric Field|Aetheric Field]].

[[Geography/Ushas/index|Ushas]] had three Higher Kind: Harmony, Ruin and Preservation. [[People/Samael|Samael]] of [[Org/Sacrament|Sacrament]] killed Ruin with a golden needle of [[Phenomena/Holy Gold|holy gold]], and [[People/Dorcan|Dorcan]] took up Ruin's mantle and became the new Ruin. The Higher Kind of Old Thessia, whose name is lost, is called [[Divinity/Formless|Formless]].
